<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch Triodos Bank posts higher 1996 net profit.</title>
<headline>Dutch Triodos Bank posts higher 1996 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     1.0  vs   0.7</p>
<p>    Total income			  12.5  vs   9.6</p>
<p>    Total operating costs		9.5  vs   6.8</p>
<p>    Loan loss provision		  1.4  vs   1.8</p>
<p>    Tax					0.6  vs   0.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Unlisted Triodos Bank NV said it expected further growth in the years ahead. The social and environmental bank bases its policy not only on financial grounds but also on ethical motives.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
